# 2. DATABASE_URL (Connection Pooler)
# For production serverless deployments (Vercel, AWS Lambda, etc.) to prevent connection exhaustion.
# If using Supavisor pooler (Port 6543 with transaction pooling):
# Format: postgresql://postgres.brqrnghtsdetmdrpphsc:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@aws-0-[REGION].pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?pgbouncer=true
#
# For direct session mode (or initial cloud testing before pooler activation):
